title: Sam
---
<<declare $talkedToSam = false>>

<<if $talkedToSam>>
    Sam: Go get your chapel credits!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Sam: Friendly reminder from your RA, make sure to get the rest of your chapel credits done today! Wouldn't want to get behind!

-> Sir yes sir! <<if hasActions()>>
    <<jump NoChapelCredits>>
-> Already done! <<if hasChapelPass() and hasActions()>>
    <<jump HasChapelPass>>
===

title: NoChapelCredits
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $talkedToSam = true>>
I can grind one out during class, but Dr. Dickinson wouldn't be too happy if he saw me. I need a way to distract him...
<<stop>>
===

title: HasChapelPass
---
Sam: Cheater.
<<stop>>
